


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_147b4011:



    voice "d/HIN_1163"
    hina "「小文……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_8a27e6c6:



    voice "d/FUM_0985"
    fumi "「阳菜……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_f648b4e6:


    "窗帘摊开到窗边的地面上，变成了床单。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_ed9ed837:


    "漂浮在白色海洋的两人，相视着呼唤对方的名字。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_9fc51157:


    "周末的教室里，静得可以听到彼此的心跳声。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_89503620:



    voice "d/HIN_1164"
    hina "「最喜欢你了……小文」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_d96734e7:



    voice "d/FUM_0986"
    fumi "「我也……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_b8746007:


    "湿润的眼眸里映出对方的面容，缓缓摇曳。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_623ba70b:


    "这是自教堂那次初体验之后的第二次幽会。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_16a89928:


    "期间也经常拥抱和接吻。但像这样肌肤相亲是第二次。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_98621d80:


    "借换窗帘为由，两人申请到了周日来教室的许可。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_f7262e40:



    voice "d/HIN_1165"
    hina "「冷吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_0c4f7325:



    voice "d/FUM_0987"
    fumi "「没事，有阳菜抱着我」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_145552d4:



    voice "d/HIN_1166"
    hina "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_fe456bc8:


    "看到文点头同意后，阳菜幸福地把脸埋进文的胸间。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_22f84531:



    voice "d/FUM_0988"
    fumi "「呵呵」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_5e45f884:


    "文也爱怜地抚摸着阳菜的头发。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_ce3c223b:


    "少女们在耳畔甜蜜地私语，不时发出低声的欢笑。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_6c1c7e12:


    "在脸颊上轻啄数次后，像磁石吸引一般，唇与唇再次贴合在了一起。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_67f827fd:



    voice "d/HIN_1167"
    hina "「嗯……呼……嗯啾」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_a6089e2f:



    voice "d/FUM_0989"
    fumi "「啊……嗯……呼」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_78bad9a5:



    voice "d/HIN_1168"
    hina "「呼啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_279aafce:



    voice "d/FUM_0990"
    fumi "「呼……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_83669b8b:


    "甜蜜的喘息声诉说着吻的结束。二人的唇舌之间拉出了一条银丝。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_8f458b7b:



    voice "d/HIN_1169"
    hina "「小文……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_dc29d3e1:


    "文领会了阳菜的意思，默默点头。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_bf128014:


    "阳菜的手指陷进了文丰满的乳房里。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_9d8a874b:



    voice "d/FUM_0991"
    fumi "「啊……嗯嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_6c48c08a:


    "文的丰乳任由阳菜手指的摆布，不断随之改变形状。唇齿之间，文不由得漏出娇喘。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_553eefc0:



    voice "d/FUM_0992"
    fumi "「阳菜……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_ff358de4:


    "阳菜也点头接受了文。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_f01f74b9:



    voice "d/HIN_1170"
    hina "「呀……啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_1fa8ef33:


    "文的手指揪住蓓蕾时，阳菜也发出了小小的嗔叫。尽管胸不大，但似乎足够敏感。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_3126802a:



    voice "d/FUM_0993"
    fumi "「阳菜的……变硬了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_74ad30d4:



    voice "d/HIN_1171"
    hina "「因为……小文……在摸那里……啊……呜嗯！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_27dc2a4d:


    "文的指腹温柔地按压乳头。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_f9f3bc00:



    voice "d/FUM_0994"
    fumi "「看起来很享受的表情……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_8811d591:


    "文陶醉地抬眼看向阳菜的脸。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_95437fba:



    voice "d/HIN_1172"
    hina "「讨厌……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_f71d1266:


    "发现文正在欣赏自己，阳菜撇开了眼。接着直接低下头吮吸文的乳头。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_1c45f96e:



    voice "d/FUM_0995"
    fumi "「啊……嗯嗯！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_0b3baa42:



    voice "d/HIN_1173"
    hina "「啊……哈啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_12f7dc97:


    "连向前探身的阳菜也叫出了声。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_f60dc368:



    voice "d/FUM_0996"
    fumi "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_b0d1def2:


    "文注意到自己的大腿碰到了阳菜的那处潮湿。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_7213e92c:



    voice "d/FUM_0997"
    fumi "「阳菜的……变得好烫……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_1ae2e567:



    voice "d/HIN_1174"
    hina "「啊……不要……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_4cffb19c:


    "阳菜反射性的想站起来，但文紧紧地夹着阳菜的腿。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_355caab2:



    voice "d/FUM_0998"
    fumi "「摩擦的时候……会很舒服吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_7fcea4fe:


    "阳菜害羞地点了点头。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_0182f796:



    voice "d/HIN_1175"
    hina "「……会弄脏小文的腿的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_e8e04901:



    voice "d/FUM_0999"
    fumi "「没事，我希望你能舒服……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_9dfeaa1d:



    voice "d/HIN_1176"
    hina "「小文……啊啊……嗯嗯……！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_3070fdc7:


    "摩擦的地方发出了黏稠的水声。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_6c979f61:



    voice "d/HIN_1177"
    hina "「小文……小文的那个地方……也好烫呀？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_c4d0ad31:


    "阳菜的膝盖碰到文的秘处，那里和阳菜的一样，已经烫到快融化了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_1faf4b09:



    voice "d/FUM_1000"
    fumi "「啊……那里被阳菜的膝盖……顶着转来转去的……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_e78ccf0a:



    voice "d/HIN_1178"
    hina "「小文也……很舒服吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_5fb162d1:


    "文点点头。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_683a9b75:


    "两人看着彼此火热的脸庞，淫靡的视线交融在一起。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_5f07ffca:


    "就算不流露于言语，两个人的欲求也是一致的。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_75d69a3b:



    voice "d/FUM_1001"
    fumi "「啊……啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_98b3b775:



    voice "d/HIN_1179"
    hina "「呀嗯！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_660a6648:


    "两人同时娇喘出声。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_6ff5e130:


    "静谧的午后，教室里回荡着两人奏响的淫乱水声。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_a9248c07:



    voice "d/HIN_1180"
    hina "「哈……呜……这个，好棒……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_4698ec84:


    "阳菜在文的大腿上扭动腰肢，摩擦自己的花瓣。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_1b81df84:



    voice "d/FUM_1002"
    fumi "「我也是……摩擦着舒服的位置……哈啊啊嗯！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_657e5f31:


    "文的大腿紧紧地固定住阳菜的膝盖，于是每当阳菜扭腰时，便会刺激到文敏感的珍珠。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_e32d2cf4:


    "最开始还是有些僵硬的运动，在润滑的帮助下变得流畅起来。零乱的节奏也逐渐达到协调。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_a81fdc30:



    voice "d/HIN_1181"
    hina "「小文……小文……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_b0db827a:



    voice "d/FUM_1003"
    fumi "「阳菜……啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_f848e5e2:


    "生怕对方会突然离开似的，二人紧紧握着彼此的手。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_b5bc8c6f:



    voice "d/HIN_1182"
    hina "「不行……变得好奇怪……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_29496284:



    voice "d/FUM_1004"
    fumi "「我也是……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_37ad56c2:


