    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_05c150c8:


    "两人抱在一起，飘浮在白色床单的海洋中。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_scene04_a5b92a80:



